e, and continues to work without rest thereafter."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is married to a millionaire's daughter, but is currently separated (not because of being in bad terms)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A Chopin-pianist who is still famous in the world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A physically strong person, but has few opportunities to appear on stage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Can play and listen to any kind of music."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c92357"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c92370","characterName":"六 深菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c92370"},"originalCharacterName":"六 深菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"21"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl with a relatively clear background."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Handles all keyboard instruments."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Possess a brilliant technique by pursuing her own convenience settings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Can play the role of Boke and Tsukkomi, but both are weak."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Play and listen to any kind of music."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When we notice it, she is eating a baked snack or something."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special skills include cooking, piano, rope jumping, and dancing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has the ability to recall about 80 percent of the new modern Waka poems."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seems to have a special interest in Saigyou's poet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Loves Frederic Chopin and Tsuda Jun's music."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c92370"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image